    <!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>CampusRate</title>
<style>
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial;background:#f5f7ff;text-align:center;color:#222}
header{background:#4f46e5;color:white;padding:20px;font-size:25px;font-weight:bold}
.hero{background:white;padding:60px 20px}
h1{font-size:35px}
span{color:#4f46e5}
p{color:#666;font-size:17px}
button{background:#4f46e5;color:white;border:0;padding:14px 25px;border-radius:10px;font-size:16px}
.section{padding:40px 20px}
.card{background:white;margin:15px auto;padding:25px;max-width:400px;border-radius:15px}
h3{color:#4f46e5}
footer{background:#111827;color:white;padding:25px;margin-top:30px}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>CampusRate ⭐</header>

<div class="hero">
<h1>Rate Your <span>Campus</span> Experience</h1>
<p>Share your experience and help students discover better learning experiences.</p>
<button>Start Rating</button>
</div>

<div class="section">
<h2>How CampusRate Works</h2>

<div class="card">
<h3>⭐ Rate Teachers</h3>
<p>Give ratings to your teachers based on your semester experience.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>📝 Give Feedback</h3>
<p>Share useful feedback about your classroom experience.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>🎓 Help Students</h3>
<p>Your feedback can help other students.</p>
</div>

</div>

<footer>© 2026 CampusRate</footer>

</body>
</html>
